<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Be my guest.</font>

168
00:11:16,250 --> 00:11:19,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">C-Could you see that?</font>

169
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:21,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not at all...</font>

170
00:11:22,540 --> 00:11:25,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you beaten?</font>

171
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:32,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">O-Of course I'm not beaten...!</font>

172
00:11:32,980 --> 00:11:34,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh.</font>

173
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:42,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-lt looks like you've studied
a bit of Kenpo somewhere, kid...</font>

174
00:11:42,490 --> 00:11:44,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, I trained!</font>

175
00:11:44,430 --> 00:11:46,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, the match starts again!</font>

176
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, here I go again!</font>

177
00:11:56,700 --> 00:12:00,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would be best to hurry
and say you're beaten!</font>

178
00:12:01,930 --> 00:12:04,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Little punk!</font>

179
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:24,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Watch out!</font>

180
00:12:35,070 --> 00:12:37,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I am beaten...</font>

181
00:12:37,170 --> 00:12:39,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks a lot!</font>

182
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:53,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I got some money!</font>

183
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:56,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who should I ask who would know?</font>

184
00:12:58,740 --> 00:13:01,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey!</font>

185
00:13:01,570 --> 00:13:04,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Take a look at that kid's hand!</font>

186
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:08,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Whoa, what a load of money!</font>

187
00:13:08,580 --> 00:13:11,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, you, little boy!</font>

188
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:15,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come over here!</font>

189
00:13:15,490 --> 00:13:17,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Over here, over here!</font>

190
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:22,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is it?</font>

191
00:13:22,460 --> 00:13:25,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right this way.</font>

192
00:13:27,970 --> 00:13:30,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you going to give me something?</font>

193
00:13:33,340 --> 00:13:36,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're the ones who're
gonna get something!</font>

194
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:38,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We'll take that money now.</font>

195
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:43,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll tell me where Bulma's house is?</font>

196
00:13:43,650 --> 00:13:49,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop yer yackin' and
make with the money!</font>

197
00:13:49,550 --> 00:13:52,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How come? Bleh!</font>

198
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:55,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're not going to tell me
where Bulma's house is?</font>

199
00:13:55,330 --> 00:13:58,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You brat! You want me to kill ya?!</font>

200
00:14:07,570 --> 00:14:09,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Punk kid!</font>

201
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:19,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">L-Let me see... Bulma-<i>chan</i>'s house?</font>

202
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:24,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-Wouldn't a police officer
know if you asked one?</font>

203
00:14:24,220 --> 00:14:28,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A person named "Police Officer"? Thank you!</font>

204
00:14:28,190 --> 00:14:32,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N-No, you're welcome.</font>

205
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:40,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you're looking for a police officer,</font>

206
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:43,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">that person over there is one.</font>

207
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:49,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you! Here you go!</font>

208
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:52,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! "Police Officer"!</font>

209
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:59,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A girl by the name of Bulma? You
don't know her citizen number, either?</font>

210
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:01,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't know what to tell you...</font>

211
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's see...</font>

212
00:15:12,290 --> 00:15:14,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">She looks like this!</font>

213
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:17,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-That's a little...</font>

214
00:15:17,570 --> 00:15:19,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You don't know?</font>

215
00:15:19,770 --> 00:15:24,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, well, I'll check the computer for you.</font>

216
00:15:24,140 --> 00:15:28,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Normally we aren't allowed
to do this for civilians, though.</font>

217
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:30,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-u-l-m-a...</font>

218
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:34,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's a rare name, so it
shouldn't take long to find out!</font>

219
00:15:34,420 --> 00:15:37,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There are three people,
which one is it?</font>

220
00:15:38,590 --> 00:15:40,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is it this person?</font>

221
00:15:40,490 --> 00:15:42,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No!</font>

222
00:15:42,090 --> 00:15:45,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then... what about this one?</font>

223
00:15:45,890 --> 00:15:48,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's Bulma!</font>

224
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is amazing!</font>

225
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:53,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is the daughter of the
head of Capsule Corporation!</font>

226
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:56,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! So where is Bulma's house?!</font>

227
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:59,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's a little far, so I'll take you there.</font>

228
00:15:59,450 --> 00:16:00,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get on.</font>

229
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:20,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry for repeating myself, but are you
really an acquaintance of Bulma-<i>san</i>?</font>

230
00:16:20,810 --> 00:16:22,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I told you, I am!</font>

231
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:40,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, we're here.</font>

232
00:16:42,570 --> 00:16:46,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is it?! What a huge house!</font>

233
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:52,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma!</font>

234
00:16:52,990 --> 00:16:57,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm here!</font>

235
00:16:57,130 --> 00:16:59,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma!</font>

236
00:16:59,170 --> 00:17:05,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, there's no need to shout so loud.
There <i>is</i> an interphone, you know.</font>

237
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that?</font>

238
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:09,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Um, hello?</font>

239
00:17:09,780 --> 00:17:14,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I believe a person by the
name of Bulma is here, but...</font>

240
00:17:14,950 --> 00:17:20,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It appears Bulma-<i>sama</i>
is currently at school.</font>

241
00:17:20,450 --> 00:17:23,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How come the pillar's talking?</font>

242
00:17:23,490 --> 00:17:28,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see. Come to think of it,
school is still in session...</font>

243
00:17:28,330 --> 00:17:30,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What will you...?!</font>

244
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:33,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-Hey!</font>

245
00:17:33,770 --> 00:17:36,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What will you do? Can you wait?</font>

246
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:39,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah. You can go now if
you want, "Police Officer."</font>

247
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:42,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't do that. I don't
know who you really are,</font>

248
00:17:42,810 --> 00:17:44,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and if it turns out I brought
a bad person here,</font>

249
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:47,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">then I would be in big trouble.</font>

250
00:17:47,180 --> 00:17:50,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's okay! I'm not a bad person!</font>

251
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:51,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wonder.</font>

252
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:54,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In any case, seeing as
the Capsule Corporation</font>

253
00:17:54,050 --> 00:17:57,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">is one of the top-class
businesses in the world,</font>

254
00:17:57,360 --> 00:18:00,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I find it a bit hard to believe</font>

255
00:18:00,030 --> 00:18:01,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">that you're an acquaintance
of its owner's daughter.</font>

256
00:18:01,790 --> 00:18:05,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? I can smell Bulma...</font>

257
00:18:05,530 --> 00:18:07,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?! Smell...?</font>

258
00:18:34,230 --> 00:18:36,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma!</font>

259
00:18:36,860 --> 00:18:40,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Hi!
--Son-<i>kun</i>! If it isn't Son-<i>kun</i>!</font>

260
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:44,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You were pretty smart to find my house!</font>

261
00:18:44,740 --> 00:18:49,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, I had this old man called
"Police Officer" bring me here!</font>

262
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:53,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A-Are you the daughter of the
head of this Capsule Corporation?</font>

263
00:18:53,710 --> 00:18:55,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right. Thanks.</font>

264
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:57,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So? Is there something you need?</font>

265
00:18:57,680 --> 00:19:00,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Dragon Radar you gave me broke,</font>

266
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:03,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so I want to get it fixed.</font>

267
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:06,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, is that so?
Sure thing. Come with me!</font>

268
00:19:08,950 --> 00:19:12,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>T-That's odd... Does she</i>
<i>really smell that much?</i></font>

269
00:19:12,990 --> 00:19:15,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">U-Uh, sorry to ask you...</font>

270
00:19:15,790 --> 00:19:18,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...but do you think you could fix
my scooter while you're at it?</font>

271
00:19:18,490 --> 00:19:20,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's not in the greatest condition...</font>

272
00:19:20,830 --> 00:19:23,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, sure. Come on in.</font>

273
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:27,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By the way, is school out already?</font>

274
00:19:27,470 --> 00:19:30,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It was boring, so I ditched.</font>

275
00:19:30,470 --> 00:19:33,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--But you mustn't ditch school!
--I'm home!</font>

276
00:19:33,910 --> 00:19:36,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Welcome back.</font>

277
00:19:38,580 --> 00:19:40,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Weird...</font>

278
00:19:43,990 --> 00:19:46,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, where's Dad?</font>

279
00:19:46,890 --> 00:19:50,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I believe he is in the garden.</font>

280
00:19:50,190 --> 00:19:52,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ah, okay.</font>

281
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:55,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That iguana soup last night was good.</font>

282
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:58,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Make it again, okay?</font>

283
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:00,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you.</font>

284
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:06,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your house is humongous!</font>

285
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:13,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh?! We're back outside again!</font>

286
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:16,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're not outside.
This is the 1st-floor garden.</font>

287
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:22,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There certainly are a lot
of cats and dogs and such...</font>

288
00:20:22,290 --> 00:20:29,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dad takes in lots of abandoned cats,
dogs, and dinosaurs from all over.</font>

289
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Welcome back, Bulma.</font>

290
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:34,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ah, here he is.</font>

291
00:20:36,090 --> 00:20:37,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And who is this?</font>

292
00:20:37,690 --> 00:20:39,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've talked about him a lot before.</font>

293
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:42,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This boy is Son-<i>kun</i>.</font>

294
00:20:42,860 --> 00:20:45,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh! Is that so?</font>

295
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:50,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see! I heard you were really short,
but you're actually quite big!</font>

296
00:20:50,370 --> 00:20:53,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You don't look 12 at all!</font>

297
00:20:53,590 --> 00:20:55,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">U-Uh, I'm...</font>

298
00:20:55,490 --> 00:20:59,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Dad!
--<i>I'm</i> Goku, Mister.</font>

299
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? You are?</font>

300
00:21:01,830 --> 00:21:04,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Hi!
--I see. You <i>are</i> short!</font>

301
00:21:04,770 --> 00:21:10,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This person is the Professor
Brief who invented capsules?</font>

302
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:14,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I hear you're quite strong.</font>

303
00:21:14,710 --> 00:21:17,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hi!</font>

304
00:21:17,580 --> 00:21:22,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're going upstairs. Take a look
at this officer's scooter, Dad.</font>

305
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:25,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's go, Son-<i>kun</i>.</font>

306
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:28,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You two are at the kissing stage now?</font>

307
00:21:28,590 --> 00:21:30,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course we are <i>not</i>!</font>

308
00:21:30,300 --> 00:21:32,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You certainly are slow...</font>

309
00:21:44,580 --> 00:21:47,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You really know a lot about
complicated things like this.</font>

310
00:21:47,750 --> 00:21:51,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Circuit A2 is almost entirely busted.</font>

311
00:21:51,850 --> 00:21:55,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You must have really used it roughly.</font>

312
00:21:55,650 --> 00:21:58,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I just had it inside here the whole time.</font>

313
00:21:58,820 --> 00:22:04,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'd like it if you used it
more carefully this time.</font>

314
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:07,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Alright, all fixed!
--That's great!</font>

315
00:22:10,600 --> 00:22:14,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? You've only got two of the balls.</font>

316
00:22:14,470 --> 00:22:17,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You sure are lollygagging!</font>

317
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:21,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Finding them is pretty tough.</font>

318
00:22:21,010 --> 00:22:26,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you had me with you, we'd have
all seven balls in no time flat...</font>

319
00:22:26,180 --> 00:22:29,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So why don't I help you out?</font>

320
00:22:29,850 --> 00:22:33,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No thanks! Your reflexes are slow,
so you'll just be in the way!</font>

321
00:22:33,660 --> 00:22:37,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In the way?! I'm one of
the best girls there is!</font>

322
00:22:37,460 --> 00:22:39,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And you can't ride <i>Kinto Un</i>, either...</font>

323
00:22:41,700 --> 00:22:44,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, but I can!</font>

324
00:22:47,500 --> 00:22:50,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tadah! Have a look at this!</font>

325
00:22:50,330 --> 00:22:51,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that?</font>

326
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:54,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's a Micro-Band that I made.</font>

327
00:22:54,870 --> 00:22:58,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If I press this button, I can shrink in size.</font>

328
00:23:07,550 --> 00:23:12,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Amazing! You've turned
small like a mouse!</font>

329
00:23:12,090 --> 00:23:14,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you think? Surprised, huh?</font>

330
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:16,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now you can easily carry me around!</font>

331
00:23:16,530 --> 00:23:18,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I can ride on <i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

332
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:24,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, so <i>you're</i> Goku-<i>chan</i>?</font>

333
00:23:26,460 --> 00:23:31,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a pleasure it is to meet you.
I'm Bulma's mother!</font>

334
00:23:39,040 --> 00:23:43,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, what are you doing
under my foot, Bulma?!</font>

335
00:23:43,270 --> 00:23:45,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>You</i> stepped on me, Mom!</font>

336
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:48,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's because you shrunk
down in a place like that...</font>

337
00:23:48,140 --> 00:23:52,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's your fault for
suddenly showing up, Mom!</font>

338
00:23:52,080 --> 00:23:55,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Forgive my daughter. She can be noisy...</font>

339
00:23:55,620 --> 00:23:59,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here you are, Goku-<i>chan</i>,
have some alcohol.</font>

340
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:01,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be giving alcohol to kids!</font>

341
00:24:01,690 --> 00:24:06,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Going through that rebellious period...</font>

342
